{
    "title": "Yatzy",
    "description": "Welcome to Yatzy by Staple Games, the simple and straight-to-the-point dice game from Staple Games. We believe games should be easy to understand and fun to play. That's why our Yatzy is just like the classic game you love, but without any extra stuff you don't need. There are no in-app purchases, no leaderboards, no in-game currencies, and no loading screens. Just Yatzy, pure and simple.\r\n\r\nIn Yatzy, you roll five dice up to three times on your turn to make different combinations for points. You can keep some dice and re-roll others to get the combinations you need. The game is about planning and luck. There are 13 rounds, and in each round, you choose which score box to fill in based on your dice roll. The goal is to score the most points by filling in the right boxes with high scores.\r\n\r\nIf you're tired of games that ask for more than just fun, or if you've never played Yatzy and want a simple place to start, try our game. Staple Games' Yatzy is here to bring you back to the joy of playing games for fun. Let's roll the dice and enjoy the game together.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Yatzy by Staple Games, the simple and straight-to-the-point dice game from Staple Games. We believe games should be easy to understand and fun to play. That&#39;s why our Yatzy is just like the classic game you love, but without any extra stuff you don&#39;t need. There are no in-app purchases, no leaderboards, no in-game currencies, and no loading screens. Just Yatzy, pure and simple.<br><br>In Yatzy, you roll five dice up to three times on your turn to make different combinations for points. You can keep some dice and re-roll others to get the combinations you need. The game is about planning and luck. There are 13 rounds, and in each round, you choose which score box to fill in based on your dice roll. The goal is to score the most points by filling in the right boxes with high scores.<br><br>If you&#39;re tired of games that ask for more than just fun, or if you&#39;ve never played Yatzy and want a simple place to start, try our game. Staple Games&#39; Yatzy is here to bring you back to the joy of playing games for fun. Let&#39;s roll the dice and enjoy the game together.",
